# Intentionally empty.
#
# The backend is a functions-only deploy: `api/index.ts` handles every request
# and vercel.json rewrites `/(.*)` to it, so nothing static is ever served. But
# the build still has to produce an output directory or Vercel fails the deploy
# with "No Output Directory named 'public' found" — `buildCommand` here is
# `pnpm typecheck`, which emits no files at all.
#
# So this directory exists to be found and left alone. Git does not track empty
# directories, which is why this file is here rather than nothing.
